(peaceful Asidonhopo)", whereupon it scans the data file for
"Asidonhopo", not for "human". Anyway, you can always follow your
command by "/nhuman", shich will correctly identify humans for you.

By the way, on the krl site, the file can be found in the directory
/pub/nethack/Data.

